	(text "Per output: rail -> pull-up (47 k at 50 V: 1 mA, 48 mW; 22 k at 20 V: 0.8 mA) -> LED -> output. LED on = transistor on.\nSense: 220 k / 47 k divider -> 74HC165 (3.3 V). Reads 0 below 5.6 V, 1 above 13 V at the output: TIP122 on (0.8 V) reads 0.\nAt 60 V the 220 k limits the clamp current to 0.25 mA. Coils 1-16: STP22NE10L MOSFET, 17-32: TIP122 Darlington.\nJ10 pin 1 = 24 VAC: NOT connected. J10 pins 2-5 = ground reference of the board. J10 pin 6 = +50 V (unfused)."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 15.24 12.7 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.5 1.5)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "aea55cb8-e306-5fa2-8ac2-e0c1f878270a")
	)
